# Build output for this standalone tool. The workspace .gitignore covers
# `/target` at the root only, and this crate is deliberately not a workspace
# member, so its target directory needs ignoring here.
/target

# Cargo.lock IS committed for this crate: it is a binary, not a library, and
# zero-dependency tools should still build reproducibly. The root lockfile is
# a separate file and is unaffected.